+- **Outputs**: A boolean mask `valid_mask` of size $N$ indicating which rays intersect the scene; optionally, filtered ray origins and directions [S2, unofficial].
 
 **Data Structures**
-- **AABB**: Two 3D vectors, `aabb[0]` (min) and `aabb[1]` (max).
